{"content":[{"c":["ASSIR"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Korah’s son and a descendant of Levi through Kohath (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.6.24","r":"Exod.6.24","rawR":"Exod.6.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.6.24","value":"Exod.6.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 6:24"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.22","r":"1Chr.6.22","rawR":"1Chr.6.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.22","value":"1Chr.6.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:22"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Ebiasaph’s son and a descendant of #1 above (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.23,37","r":"1Chr.6.23,37","rawR":"1Chr.6.23,37","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.23,37","value":"1Chr.6.23,37"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:23, 37"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Son of Jeconiah (Jehoiachin), king of Judah (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.3.17","r":"1Chr.3.17","rawR":"1Chr.3.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.3.17","value":"1Chr.3.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 3:17"},", ",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},"). It has been suggested that the Hebrew word ",{"c":["assir"],"sourceClass":"hebrew","t":"span"}," may here be an adjective (as in ",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},") describing Jeconiah and meaning “while captive” (cf. ",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.24.15","r":"2Kgs.24.15","rawR":"2Kgs.24.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.24.15","value":"2Kgs.24.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 24:15"},"). If so, his children were born while he was a captive."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Assir","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Ex 6:24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.6.24","rawQueryValue":"Exod.6.24","sourceRefExact":"Exod.6.24"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.22","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.22","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.22"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:23, 37","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.23,37","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.23,37","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.23,37"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 3:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.3.17","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.3.17","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.3.17"},{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 24:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.24.15","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.24.15","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.24.15"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"7ab46045e26136a4f6c13e4f40e529be59be898be2f7a9d4e632cf77a4f22724","sourceItemName":"Assir","sourceItemOrder":577,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Assir","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Assir","title":"Assir","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}